  "changelog": "Initial public release.\n\n- Fuses DEM/DSM and building height data into a 3D city digital twin scene configuration and OpenAPI-style interface description.\n- Supports synthetic (offline) and real data sources as multi-band GeoTIFFs.\n- Outputs include building height raster, LOD1 building blocks (GeoJSON), scene config, API spec, completeness report, and manifest.\n- Command-line interface with options for configurable bbox, formats, thresholds, and output directories.\n- Processes data locally (no upload or online requirement); full privacy by design.\n- Dependencies: numpy, rasterio, geopandas, shapely, scipy.",
